{
  "schema": "geotrace-felt-mapping.v1",
  "purpose": "The Earth->AoE2 translation table geo-trace's classifier consumes. Per cell (climate_zone x elevation_band x distance_to_shore) -> AoE2 terrain_id PROPORTIONS + confidence + reason, plus species per (climate x band) for cluster_scatter. This is the felt project's payoff for tracing, and the SHARED PALETTE every trace-worm uses so no bird re-derives it. Consumes Dex's interface: {x,y,lat,lon,elevation_m,land,distance_to_shore_tiles,elevation_band in [water,beach,lowland,upland,highland],climate_zone}.",
  "confidence_ladder": [
    "from_data",
    "inferred",
    "default"
  ],
  "climate_shore_rule": "THE naturalism climate rule, automated: warm zones (tropical/subtropical) -> tan/white SAND beaches + AZURE water tint. temperate -> sand or mixed, blue water. cold (boreal/polar) -> snow/ice/rock coast, blue-gray water. arid coast -> tan sand, clear blue. mediterranean -> tan sand, blue. Gaia decorative placement is guarded separately from terrain choice.",
