  "for_the_village": "This table is climate x band x distance -> terrain proportions + species. Any bird tracing ANY place picks a climate_zone (or per-cell from latitude/Koppen) and the mapping is done. A land-cover provider will later REPLACE the inferred wetland/forest guesses with from_data biome classes; until then, wetland/forest are held at 'inferred'. For NON-map tracing (images/art), a sibling color-mapping table maps source COLOR -> terrain instead of elevation_band -> terrain; same proportions+confidence shape.",
