  "coast_type_rule": "EVERY coast cell resolves to SANDY-BEACH (warm/open) or MANGROVE-BEACH (brackish/sheltered) — never bare/rock/other. Mangrove-beach = mangrove-floor(55) + mangrove(1144) in the fringing water; sandy-beach = white/tan beach + tide-gated palms.",
